  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wable&#x2019;s mission is to provide clean water close to people in areas where water isn&#x2019;t easily available. They provide water points (M-Safi they call it) where people can use (mobile)money to buy the amount of water they wish take. The water comes from (unclean) lakes and they automatically purify it per location themselves.</narrative>
